              md:col-start-1 md:col-span-6
              lg:col-start-1 lg:col-span-9
              xl:col-start-1 xl:col-span-12
            "><h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl 2xl:text-[88px] xl:w-[600px] 2xl:w-[800px] font-bold mb-6 md:mb-10 xl:mb-[50px]">The Most Accurate Golf Simulator for Home &amp; Commercial Spaces</h1><p class="w-full font-medium text-base xl:text-lg mb-6">The world&#x27;s most accurate indoor golf simulator. Tour-proven radar and camera technology, Virtual Golf 3, and 500+ courses. Complete simulator packages from USD 29,715.</p><div class="w-full flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center md:justify-start md:items-start gap-2.5 md:gap-5 mt-6 flex-row"><a target="_self" class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md font-medium text-base xl:text-lg ring-offset-white transition-all duration-300 focus-visible:outline-hidden disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 dark:ring-offset-neutral-950 text-tm-c-light border-2 border-tm-c-primary w-fit text-center bg-tm-c-primary py-2 px-6 hover:bg-[#ab490e] hover:border-[#ab490e]" href="/golf/simulator/get-your-own">Get your own</a><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="primary-hero-video-dialog" aria-label="Watch video: [object Object]" class="xl:hidden flex flex-nowrap items-center gap-1 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-[100px] bg-[rgba(9,9,9,0.6)] text-white text-xs font-medium whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer"><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center w-[30px] h-[30px] rounded-full bg-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="w-5 h-5 text-[rgba(9,9,9,0.6)]"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg></span><span>Watch video</span></button></div></div><div class="
              col-start-1 col-span-4 justify-center
              md:col-start-1 md:col-span-8 md:justify-start
              lg:col-start-1 lg:col-span-9
              xl:col-start-20 xl:col-span-14 xl:justify-end
              mt-5 md:mt-10 xl:mt-0
              md:self-end
              grid grid-flow-col auto-cols-fr md:auto-cols-[185px] sm:auto-cols-fr
              gap-2 xl:gap-4
              items-stretch
              w-full
            "></div></div><div class="hidden xl:block pointer-events-none absolute bottom-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-[6]"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 23" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="butt" stroke-linejoin="miter" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-12 h-auto" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><style>
