ms-center z-1 px-10 md:px-0 h-[100vh] md:h-[100vh]"><div class="grid-container self-end md:self-center mb-32 md:mb-0"><div class="text-tm-c-light text-center col-start-1 col-span-4 md:col-start-2 md:col-span-4 lg:col-start-3 lg:col-span-6 xl:col-start-7 xl:col-span-12 2xl:col-start-7 2xl:col-span-10 md:text-left"><h2 class="mb-6 [&amp;&gt;u]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;u]:text-tm-c-primary drop-shadow-2xl">Why accuracy matters</h2><p class="font-medium text-base lg:text-lg mb-5 last-of-type:mb-0 drop-shadow-2xl">Camera and radar each have strengths and weaknesses. Most simulators use one or the other — and estimate what they can&#x27;t measure.</p><p class="font-medium text-base lg:text-lg mb-5 last-of-type:mb-0 drop-shadow-2xl">Trackman combines both, using the best of each technology. And unlike competitors that only track initial launch conditions, our models are built on billions of measured full ball flights.</p><p class="font-medium text-base lg:text-lg mb-5 last-of-type:mb-0 drop-shadow-2xl">What you see on screen matches what happens on the course.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-5 mt-6 flex-row items-center justify-center md:justify-start"><a target="_self" class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md font-medium text-base xl:text-lg ring-offset-white transition-all duration-300 focus-visible:outline-hidden disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 dark:ring-offset-neutral-950 text-tm-c-light border-2 border-tm-c-primary w-fit text-center bg-tm-c-primary py-2 px-6 hover:bg-[#ab490e] hover:border-[#ab490e]" href="/blog/golf/what-is-a-golf-launch-monitor">Learn more</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="px-10 md:px-0 bg-tm-c-dark text-tm-c-light pb-[5rem] pt-[7.5rem] md:pt-[10rem]"><div class="grid-container"><div class="col-start-1 col-span-4 md:col-start-2 md:col-span-6 lg:col-start-5 lg:col-span-8 xl:col-start-9 xl:col-[span_16_/_span_16] *:text-center"><h2 class="mb-6 [&amp;&gt;u]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;u]:text-tm-c-primary">THREE COMPONENTS, ENDLESS POSSIBILITIES</h2><p class="font-medium text-base lg:text-lg mb-5 last-of-type:mb-0">A golf simulator consists of three connected components: the engine, the software and the space. Here’s a closer look at how Trackman brings them all together to deliver the best of indoor golf.</p></div></div></section><section class="px-10 lg:px-0 bg-tm-c-dark text-tm-c-light pt-[3.75rem] pb-[3.75rem]"><div class="grid-container"><div class="relative self-center aspect-square col-start-1 col-span-4 md:mr-5 lg:mr-0 lg:col-start-3 lg:col-span-6 xl:col-start-7 xl:col-span-9 row-start-1 mb-6 md:mb-0"><img alt="Two TrackMan devices, one orange and one black, featuring cameras and sleek designs, used for sports performance analysis." loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 28vw, (min-width: 1024px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2Fbad2ae56e0%2Fthe_engins_simulators_trackman_golf.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=100 256w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2Fbad2ae56e0%2Fthe_engins_simulators_trackman_golf.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=100 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2Fbad2ae56e0%2Fthe_engins_simulators_trackman_golf.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=100 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2Fbad2ae56e0%2Fthe_engins_simulators_trackman_golf.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=100 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2Fbad2ae56e0%2Fthe_engins_simulators_trackman_golf.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=100 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2Fbad2ae56e0%2Fthe_engins_simulators_trackman_golf.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=100 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2Fbad2ae56e0%2Fthe_engins_simulators_trackman_golf.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=100 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2Fbad2ae56e0%2Fthe_engins_simulators_trackman_golf.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=100 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2Fbad2ae56e0%2Fthe_engins_simulators_trackman_golf.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=100 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2Fbad2ae56e0%2Fthe_engins_simulators_trackman_golf.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2Fbad2ae56e0%2Fthe_engins_simulators_trackman_golf.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100"/></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center text-center md:text-left [&amp;_h1]:drop-shadow-2xl [&amp;_h2]:drop-shadow-2xl [&amp;_p]:drop-shadow-2xl col-start-1 col-span-4 md:ml-5 md:col-start-5 md:col-span-4 lg:ml-0 lg:col-start-10 lg:col-span-5 xl:col-start-18 xl:col-span-9 row-start-2 md:row-start-1"><h2 class="mb-6 [&amp;&gt;u]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;u]:text-tm-c-primary">THE ENGINE</h2><p class="font-medium text-base lg:text-lg mb-5 last-of-type:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;u]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;u]:text-tm-c-primary">Both of our launch monitors — the tour-trusted <a style="--rt-primary:#ec691a" class="text-[var(--rt-primary)] opacity-100 transition duration-300 hover:opacity-40" href="/golf/launch-monitors/trackman-4">Trackman 4</a> and the indoor-optimized <a style="--rt-primary:#ec691a" class="text-[var(--rt-primary)] opacity-100 transition duration-300 hover:opacity-40" href="/golf/launch-monitors/trackman-io">Trackman iO</a> — combine radar and camera technology to deliver unsurpassed accuracy.</p><p class="font-medium text-base lg:text-lg mb-5 last-of-type:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;u]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;u]:text-tm-c-primary">The same technology trusted by the PGA Tour, DP World Tour, LPGA Tour and LIV Golf as their official measurement technology — now available for your home or facility.</p><p class="font-medium text-base lg:text-lg mb-5 last-of-type:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;u]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;u]:text-tm-c-primary">We&#x27;ll work with you to identify the best option for your needs, location and budget.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-5 mt-6 flex-row items-center justify-center md:justify-start"><a target="_self" class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md font-medium text-base xl:text-lg ring-offset-white transition-all duration-300 focus-visible:outline-hidden disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 dark:ring-offset-neutral-950 text-tm-c-light border-2 border-tm-c-primary w-fit text-center bg-tm-c-primary py-2 px-6 hover:bg-[#ab490e] hover:border-[#ab490e]" href="/golf/launch-monitors">Learn more</a></div></div></div></section><section class="px-10 lg:px-0 bg-tm-c-dark text-tm-c-light pt-[3.75rem] pb-[5rem]"><div class="grid-container"><div class="relative self-center aspect-square col-start-1 col-span-4 md:ml-5 md:col-start-5 md:col-span-4 lg:ml-0 lg:col-start-10 lg:col-span-5 xl:col-start-18 xl:col-span-9 row-start-1 mb-6 md:mb-0"><img alt="A screen displaying various golf training options like shot analysis, performance center, and test center under the &quot;Practice&quot; section." loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 28vw, (min-width: 1024px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1080x1080%2F7a894c0504%2Fsimulators_overview_image.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=100 256w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1080x1080%2F7a894c0504%2Fsimulators_overview_image.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=100 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1080x1080%2F7a894c0504%2Fsimulators_overview_image.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=100 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1080x1080%2F7a894c0504%2Fsimulators_overview_image.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=100 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1080x1080%2F7a894c0504%2Fsimulators_overview_image.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=100 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1080x1080%2F7a894c0504%2Fsimulators_overview_image.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=100 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1080x1080%2F7a894c0504%2Fsimulators_overview_image.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=100 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1080x1080%2F7a894c0504%2Fsimulators_overview_image.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=100 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1080x1080%2F7a894c0504%2Fsimulators_overview_image.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=100 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1080x1080%2F7a894c0504%2Fsimulators_overview_image.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1080x1080%2F7a894c0504%2Fsimulators_overview_image.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100"/></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center text-center md:text-left [&amp;_h1]:drop-shadow-2xl [&amp;_h2]:drop-shadow-2xl [&amp;_p]:drop-shadow-2xl col-start-1 col-span-4 md:mr-5 lg:mr-0 lg:col-start-3 lg:col-span-6 xl:col-start-7 xl:col-span-9 row-start-2 md:row-start-1"><h2 class="mb-6 [&amp;&gt;u]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;u]:text-tm-c-primary">THE SOFTWARE</h2><p class="font-medium text-base lg:text-lg mb-5 last-of-type:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;u]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;u]:text-tm-c-primary">Your simulator runs on the most comprehensive software package in the industry — <a style="--rt-primary:#ec691a" class="text-[var(--rt-primary)] opacity-100 transition duration-300 hover:opacity-40" href="/golf/launch-monitors/software">Trackman Performance Studio</a> and the Trackman Golf app.</p><p class="font-medium text-base lg:text-lg mb-5 last-of-type:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;u]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;u]:text-tm-c-primary">Play 500+ world-class courses with ultra-realistic graphics. Analyze every shot with more than 40 data parameters. Track improvement over time. Practice with purpose using dedicated training modes built for every skill level.</p><p class="font-medium text-base lg:text-lg mb-5 last-of-type:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;u]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;u]:text-tm-c-primary">Regular updates mean your simulator keeps improving — Trackman units from 2016 are still in active use, continuously updated with new courses, features and performance improvements.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-5 mt-6 flex-row items-center justify-center md:justify-start"><a target="_self" class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md font-medium text-base xl:text-lg ring-offset-white transition-all duration-300 focus-visible:outline-hidden disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 dark:ring-offset-neutral-950 text-tm-c-light border-2 border-tm-c-primary w-fit text-center bg-tm-c-primary py-2 px-6 hover:bg-[#ab490e] hover:border-[#ab490e]" href="/golf/launch-monitors/software">Learn more</a></div></div></div></section><section class="grid relative bg-tm-c-dark h-[100vh] md:h-[100vh]"><img alt="Two men in a golf lesson, focusing on swing technique, with clubs and a golf bag nearby indoors." fetchPriority="auto" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="row-start-1 col-start-1 object-cover block md:hidden" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 0" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F786x1704%2Ff92e72d1f0%2Fsimulators_overview_hero1_mobile.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=100 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F786x1704%2Ff92e72d1f0%2Fsimulators_overview_hero1_mobile.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=100 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F786x1704%2Ff92e72d1f0%2Fsimulators_overview_hero1_mobile.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=100 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F786x1704%2Ff92e72d1f0%2Fsimulators_overview_hero1_mobile.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=100 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F786x1704%2Ff92e72d1f0%2Fsimulators_overview_hero1_mobile.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=100 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F786x1704%2Ff92e72d1f0%2Fsimulators_overview_hero1_mobile.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=100 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F786x1704%2Ff92e72d1f0%2Fsimulators_overview_hero1_mobile.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=100 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F786x1704%2Ff92e72d1f0%2Fsimulators_overview_hero1_mobile.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F786x1704%2Ff92e72d1f0%2Fsimulators_overview_hero1_mobile.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100"/><img alt="Golf instructor guiding a student on swing technique indoors, with equipment and seating visible in the background." loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="row-start-1 col-start-1 object-cover hidden md:block" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 0, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F3840x2160%2Ff54f4e88ff%2Fthe_space_trackman.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=100 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F3840x2160%2Ff54f4e88ff%2Fthe_space_trackman.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=100 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F3840x2160%2Ff54f4e88ff%2Fthe_space_trackman.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=100 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F3840x2160%2Ff54f4e88ff%2Fthe_space_trackman.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=100 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F3840x2160%2Ff54f4e88ff%2Fthe_space_trackman.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=100 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F3840x2160%2Ff54f4e88ff%2Fthe_space_trackman.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=100 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F3840x2160%2Ff54f4e88ff%2Fthe_space_trackman.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=100 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F3840x2160%2Ff54f4e88ff%2Fthe_space_trackman.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F3840x2160%2Ff54f4e88ff%2Fthe_space_trackman.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100"/><div class="row-start-1 col-start-1 w-full flex justify-center items-center z-1 px-10 md:px-0 h-[100vh] md:h-[100vh]"><div class="grid-container self-end md:self-center mb-32 md:mb-0"><div class="text-tm-c-light text-center col-start-1 col-span-4 md:col-start-4 md:col-span-4 lg:col-start-10 lg:col-span-5 xl:col-start-19 xl:col-span-10 md:text-left"><h2 class="mb-6 [&amp;&gt;u]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;u]:text-tm-c-primary drop-shadow-2xl">THE SPACE</h2><p class="font-medium text-base lg:text-lg mb-5 last-of-type:mb-0 drop-shadow-2xl">Every home, golf club, coaching studio and indoor facility is unique. That&#x27;s why we take a consultative approach — working with you to design a setup that fits your specific space, budget and goals, whether for entertainment, serious practice or both.</p><p class="font-medium text-base lg:text-lg mb-5 last-of-type:mb-0 drop-shadow-2xl">For a quick starting point, try the <a href="/golf/simulator/sim-builder" target="_self">Sim Builder</a> to configure your space in minutes. Or browse real <a href="/golf/simulator/build-outs" target="_self">build-outs</a> from Trackman customers for inspiration.</p><p class="font-medium text-base lg:text-lg mb-5 last-of-type:mb-0 drop-shadow-2xl">Minimum space required is 8 ft 2 in (2.5m) from screen to ball. For the best experience we recommend at least 15 ft wide, 10 ft high and 18 ft deep.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-5 mt-6 flex-row items-center justify-center md:justify-start"><a target="_self" class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md font-medium text-base xl:text-lg ring-offset-white transition-all duration-300 focus-visible:outline-hidden disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 dark:ring-offset-neutral-950 text-tm-c-light border-2 border-tm-c-primary w-fit text-center bg-tm-c-primary py-2 px-6 hover:bg-[#ab490e] hover:border-[#ab490e]" href="/golf/simulator/build-outs">See Simulators</a><a target="_self" class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md font-medium text-base xl:text-lg ring-offset-white transition-all duration-300 focus-visible:outline-hidden disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 dark:ring-offset-neutral-950 text-tm-c-light border-2 border-tm-c-primary w-fit text-center py-2 px-6 hover:bg-[#ab490e] hover:border-[#ab490e]" href="/golf/simulator/sim-builder">Try Sim Builder</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative text-base text-tm-c-light bg-tm-c-dark"><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><div class="relative aspect-4/3 lg:aspect-auto lg:h-[90vh]"></div><!--/$--></section><section class="relative text-base text-tm-c-light bg-tm-c-dark"><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><div class="relative aspect-4/3 lg:aspect-auto lg:h-[90vh]"></div><!--/$--></section><section class="px-10 lg:px-0 bg-tm-c-dark text-tm-c-light pt-[3.75rem] pb-[3.75rem]"><div class="grid-container"><div class="relative self-center aspect-square col-start-1 col-span-4 md:ml-5 md:col-start-5 md:col-span-4 lg:ml-0 lg:col-start-10 lg:col-span-5 xl:col-start-18 xl:col-span-9 row-start-1 mb-6 md:mb-0"><img alt="A computer screen displays a booking and payment grid interface, with a keyboard and mouse on the desk below." loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 28vw, (min-width: 1024px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F884fed7438%2Fsimulators_overview_image1.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=100 256w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F884fed7438%2Fsimulators_overview_image1.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=100 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F884fed7438%2Fsimulators_overview_image1.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=100 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F884fed7438%2Fsimulators_overview_image1.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=100 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F884fed7438%2Fsimulators_overview_image1.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=100 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F884fed7438%2Fsimulators_overview_image1.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=100 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F884fed7438%2Fsimulators_overview_image1.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=100 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F884fed7438%2Fsimulators_overview_image1.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=100 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F884fed7438%2Fsimulators_overview_image1.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=100 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F884fed7438%2Fsimulators_overview_image1.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F884fed7438%2Fsimulators_overview_image1.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100"/></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center text-center md:text-left [&amp;_h1]:drop-shadow-2xl [&amp;_h2]:drop-shadow-2xl [&amp;_p]:drop-shadow-2xl col-start-1 col-span-4 md:mr-5 lg:mr-0 lg:col-start-3 lg:col-span-6 xl:col-start-7 xl:col-span-9 row-start-2 md:row-start-1"><h2 class="mb-6 [&amp;&gt;u]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;u]:text-tm-c-primary">BOOKING &amp; PAYMENTS</h2><p class="font-medium text-base lg:text-lg mb-5 last-of-type:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;u]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;u]:text-tm-c-primary">Manage bookings, payments, and memberships with ease - perfectly suited for your Trackman simulator experience.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-5 mt-6 flex-row items-center justify-center md:justify-start"><a target="_self" class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md font-medium text-base xl:text-lg ring-offset-white transition-all duration-300 focus-visible:outline-hidden disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 dark:ring-offset-neutral-950 text-tm-c-light border-2 border-tm-c-primary w-fit text-center bg-tm-c-primary py-2 px-6 hover:bg-[#ab490e] hover:border-[#ab490e]" href="/lp/trackman-booking-payments">Learn more</a></div></div></div></section><section class="px-10 lg:px-0 bg-tm-c-dark text-tm-c-light pt-[5rem] pb-[7.5rem] md:pb-[10rem]"><div class="grid-container"><div class="relative self-center aspect-square col-start-1 col-span-4 md:mr-5 lg:mr-0 lg:col-start-3 lg:col-span-6 xl:col-start-7 xl:col-span-9 row-start-1 mb-6 md:mb-0"><img alt="World map with numerous white location markers concentrated in the U.S. and Europe, and scattered across other continents." loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 28vw, (min-width: 1024px) 40vw, (min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F05c51c9952%2Fsimulators_locator_trackman_golf_desktop.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=100 256w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F05c51c9952%2Fsimulators_locator_trackman_golf_desktop.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=100 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F05c51c9952%2Fsimulators_locator_trackman_golf_desktop.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=100 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F05c51c9952%2Fsimulators_locator_trackman_golf_desktop.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=100 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F05c51c9952%2Fsimulators_locator_trackman_golf_desktop.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=100 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F05c51c9952%2Fsimulators_locator_trackman_golf_desktop.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=100 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F05c51c9952%2Fsimulators_locator_trackman_golf_desktop.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=100 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F05c51c9952%2Fsimulators_locator_trackman_golf_desktop.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=100 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F05c51c9952%2Fsimulators_locator_trackman_golf_desktop.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=100 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F05c51c9952%2Fsimulators_locator_trackman_golf_desktop.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fa.storyblok.com%2Ff%2F117513%2F1200x1200%2F05c51c9952%2Fsimulators_locator_trackman_golf_desktop.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100"/></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-center text-center md:text-left [&amp;_h1]:drop-shadow-2xl [&amp;_h2]:drop-shadow-2xl [&amp;_p]:drop-shadow-2xl col-start-1 col-span-4 md:ml-5 md:col-start-5 md:col-span-4 lg:ml-0 lg:col-start-10 lg:col-span-5 xl:col-start-18 xl:col-span-9 row-start-2 md:row-start-1"><h2 class="mb-6 [&amp;&gt;u]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;u]:text-tm-c-primary">Find a golf simulator near you</h2><p class="font-medium text-base lg:text-lg mb-5 last-of-type:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;u]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;u]:text-tm-c-primary">Want to see a Trackman golf simulator in action? Use the Locator find and book a tee time today.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-5 mt-6 flex-row items-center justify-center md:justify-start"><a target="_self" class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md font-medium text-base xl:text-lg ring-offset-white transition-all duration-300 focus-visible:outline-hidden disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 dark:ring-offset-neutral-950 text-tm-c-light border-2 border-tm-c-primary w-fit text-center bg-tm-c-primary py-2 px-6 hover:bg-[#ab490e] hover:border-[#ab490e]" href="/locator">Go to Locator</a></div></div></div></section><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><div class="bg-tm-c-dark min-h-[60vh]"></div><!--/$--><section class="bg-tm-c-dark text-tm-c-light pb-[7.5rem] md:pb-[10rem]"><div class="grid-container px-5 lg:px-0"><div class="col-start-1 col-span-4 md:col-span-8 lg:col-start-3 lg:col-[span_12_/_span_12] xl:col-start-8 xl:col-[span_18_/_span_18]
          flex flex-col
          [&amp;_h1]:text-center [&amp;_h2]:text-center [&amp;_h3]:text-center
        "><h2 class="mt-[60px] mx-0 mb-[40px] font-medium text-base lg:text-lg normal-case font-inter"></h2><h2 class="mb-6 [&amp;&gt;u]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;u]:text-tm-c-primary">FAQ</h2><p class="font-medium text-base lg:text-lg mb-5 last-of-type:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;u]:no-underline [&amp;&gt;u]:text-tm-c-primary"></p><div><div class="mb-[5px] last-of-type:mb-0 rounded-[3px] cursor-pointer bg-[#41414180] hover:bg-[#414141b3]" style="transition:background-color ease 0.4s"><div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3.5 px-10 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg">How much is a golf simulator?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6 text-tm-c-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;transition:height ease 0.2s"><p class="mt-5 pb-3.5 px-10 last-of-type:mb-0 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg *:text-tm-c-light!">The cost of a Trackman golf simulator depends on your space, setup, and software package. Whether it’s for your home or a commercial facility, we’ll help you build a solution that fits your needs — just reach out for a tailored quote.</p></div></div><div class="mb-[5px] last-of-type:mb-0 rounded-[3px] cursor-pointer bg-[#41414180] hover:bg-[#414141b3]" style="transition:background-color ease 0.4s"><div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3.5 px-10 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg">How much space do I need for a golf simulator?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6 text-tm-c-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;transition:height ease 0.2s"><p class="mt-5 pb-3.5 px-10 last-of-type:mb-0 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg *:text-tm-c-light!">For the best experience, we recommend a room that’s at least 15 ft wide, 10 ft high, and 18 ft deep (approximately 4.6m x 3.1m x 5.5m). The absolute minimum space required is around 8 ft 2 in (2.5m) from screen to ball — but actual width and height depend on your swing comfort.</p><p class="mt-5 pb-3.5 px-10 last-of-type:mb-0 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg *:text-tm-c-light!">For a full breakdown by room type and launch monitor, see our <a href="/blog/golf/how-much-room-for-a-golf-simulator" target="_self">golf simulator space guide</a>.</p></div></div><div class="mb-[5px] last-of-type:mb-0 rounded-[3px] cursor-pointer bg-[#41414180] hover:bg-[#414141b3]" style="transition:background-color ease 0.4s"><div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3.5 px-10 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg">How tall does the ceiling need to be for a golf simulator?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6 text-tm-c-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;transition:height ease 0.2s"><p class="mt-5 pb-3.5 px-10 last-of-type:mb-0 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg *:text-tm-c-light!">Ceiling height depends on your swing and body height. To comfortably swing a driver, most users need at least 9 to 10 feet (2.7–3.1 m). Taller players or those with aggressive swings may require more space to avoid feeling restricted.</p></div></div><div class="mb-[5px] last-of-type:mb-0 rounded-[3px] cursor-pointer bg-[#41414180] hover:bg-[#414141b3]" style="transition:background-color ease 0.4s"><div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3.5 px-10 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg">How does a Trackman golf simulator work?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6 text-tm-c-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;transition:height ease 0.2s"><p class="mt-5 pb-3.5 px-10 last-of-type:mb-0 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg *:text-tm-c-light!">Trackman combines the best of both worlds — radar and camera tracking — to measure club and ball data with incredible precision. Paired with our Virtual Golf 3 software, it creates an ultra-realistic indoor golf experience that looks and feels just like the real thing.</p></div></div><div class="mb-[5px] last-of-type:mb-0 rounded-[3px] cursor-pointer bg-[#41414180] hover:bg-[#414141b3]" style="transition:background-color ease 0.4s"><div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3.5 px-10 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg">Can I use a Trackman golf simulator at home?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6 text-tm-c-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;transition:height ease 0.2s"><p class="mt-5 pb-3.5 px-10 last-of-type:mb-0 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg *:text-tm-c-light!">Yes, the Trackman iO Home is purpose-built for home use. It offers the same trusted accuracy and immersive software experience as our professional setups - without requiring a large space. Whether you&#x27;re building a dedicated simulator room, garage project or garden house, Trackman iO makes it possible.</p><p class="mt-5 pb-3.5 px-10 last-of-type:mb-0 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg *:text-tm-c-light!">See how others have built theirs in our <a href="/blog/golf/garage-golf-simulator" target="_self"><u>garage golf simulator guide</u></a><u>.</u></p></div></div><div class="mb-[5px] last-of-type:mb-0 rounded-[3px] cursor-pointer bg-[#41414180] hover:bg-[#414141b3]" style="transition:background-color ease 0.4s"><div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3.5 px-10 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg">What does a home golf simulator include?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6 text-tm-c-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;transition:height ease 0.2s"><p class="mt-5 pb-3.5 px-10 last-of-type:mb-0 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg *:text-tm-c-light!">A home golf simulator from Trackman is a complete, ready-to-play package — not just a screen and a mat. It combines our tour-proven radar and camera launch monitor (the same technology used on the PGA Tour), Virtual Golf 3 software with 500+ world-class courses, and a custom-built enclosure designed to fit your space. Every component is engineered to work together, so what you see on screen matches exactly what happens at impact. Complete packages start from USD 29,715 and can be configured for a dedicated golf room, garage, or basement.</p><p class="mt-5 pb-3.5 px-10 last-of-type:mb-0 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg *:text-tm-c-light!"><a href="/golf/solutions/home-golf-simulator" target="_self"><u>Explore the Trackman home golf simulator packages</u></a></p></div></div><div class="mb-[5px] last-of-type:mb-0 rounded-[3px] cursor-pointer bg-[#41414180] hover:bg-[#414141b3]" style="transition:background-color ease 0.4s"><div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3.5 px-10 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg">What is the best golf simulator for home use?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6 text-tm-c-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;transition:height ease 0.2s"><p class="mt-5 pb-3.5 px-10 last-of-type:mb-0 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg *:text-tm-c-light!">The Trackman iO Home is built specifically for golfers who want a simulator in their home. It combines our trusted radar and camera technology with ultra-realistic graphics and access to over 300 world-class courses. It’s easy to install, space-efficient, and delivers the same pro-level experience we’re known for — right in your own home.</p></div></div><div class="mb-[5px] last-of-type:mb-0 rounded-[3px] cursor-pointer bg-[#41414180] hover:bg-[#414141b3]" style="transition:background-color ease 0.4s"><div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3.5 px-10 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg">What golf simulator do tour pros use?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6 text-tm-c-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;transition:height ease 0.2s"><p class="mt-5 pb-3.5 px-10 last-of-type:mb-0 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg *:text-tm-c-light!">Every major professional golf organization — including the PGA Tour, DP World Tour, LPGA Tour and LIV Golf — independently chose Trackman as their official measurement technology. The same radar technology powering those tours powers every Trackman simulator.</p></div></div><div class="mb-[5px] last-of-type:mb-0 rounded-[3px] cursor-pointer bg-[#41414180] hover:bg-[#414141b3]" style="transition:background-color ease 0.4s"><div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3.5 px-10 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg">How accurate is a home golf simulator?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6 text-tm-c-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;transition:height ease 0.2s"><p class="mt-5 pb-3.5 px-10 last-of-type:mb-0 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg *:text-tm-c-light!">Accuracy depends entirely on the technology measuring your shots. Most simulators only track initial launch conditions and model the rest. Trackman combines radar and camera technology, with models built on billions of measured full ball flights — meaning what you see on screen matches what happens on the course.</p></div></div><div class="mb-[5px] last-of-type:mb-0 rounded-[3px] cursor-pointer bg-[#41414180] hover:bg-[#414141b3]" style="transition:background-color ease 0.4s"><div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3.5 px-10 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg">What is the difference between Trackman and other golf simulators?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6 text-tm-c-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;transition:height ease 0.2s"><p class="mt-5 pb-3.5 px-10 last-of-type:mb-0 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg *:text-tm-c-light!">Most simulators use either camera or radar technology and estimate what they can&#x27;t measure. Trackman combines both, using the best of each. And unlike competitors that only track initial launch conditions, Trackman&#x27;s models are built on billions of measured full ball flights — delivering real data, not estimates.</p></div></div><div class="mb-[5px] last-of-type:mb-0 rounded-[3px] cursor-pointer bg-[#41414180] hover:bg-[#414141b3]" style="transition:background-color ease 0.4s"><div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3.5 px-10 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg">Is a Trackman simulator worth it?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6 text-tm-c-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;transition:height ease 0.2s"><p class="mt-5 pb-3.5 px-10 last-of-type:mb-0 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg *:text-tm-c-light!">If practice is the goal, accuracy matters. A simulator that shows you the wrong carry distance or spin rate reinforces the wrong habits. Trackman is the only simulator built on the same measurement technology trusted by every major tour and equipment manufacturer — so the feedback you get indoors translates directly to the course.</p></div></div><div class="mb-[5px] last-of-type:mb-0 rounded-[3px] cursor-pointer bg-[#41414180] hover:bg-[#414141b3]" style="transition:background-color ease 0.4s"><div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3.5 px-10 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg">What is the most accurate golf simulator?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="size-6 text-tm-c-primary"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m19.5 8.25-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5"></path></svg></div><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;transition:height ease 0.2s"><p class="mt-5 pb-3.5 px-10 last-of-type:mb-0 font-medium text-base lg:text-lg *:text-tm-c-light!">Trackman is the only golf simulator combining radar and camera technology with models built on billions of measured real ball flights. It is the same technology independently chosen by the PGA Tour, DP World Tour, LPGA Tour, LIV Golf and the R&amp;A — making it the most validated measurement system in golf.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><script type="application/ld+json">{
